  "body": "## Changelog\n* 06ef2d3f70e0264b3d27619fa510c61bc3683635 Bump k8s.io/apimachinery from 0.36.2 to 0.36.3 (#1216)\n* 292a1c257cc7b994f8c306db0e99e7886ac50535 Bump k8s.io/client-go from 0.35.4 to 0.36.3 (#1217)\n* dafa0b74fc09a9505849b0a6f8c78f1c364d0112 Managed by Terraform\n* 31bc0fdb849897747295d601adb4772269dcaa19 Managed by Terraform\n* b65142e8be1a9bd506416e96d4d4d3acad0d0e27 Pin dependency rok8s to 14.4.0 (#1218)\n* cb741e3eb13a79ecd88fc5ecf61fc6a070ab7631 Update all non-major dependencies (#1219)\n* f0a370c7578e9ec725fc5fc79f3ffcb9611922d5 Update dependency rok8s to v16 (#1221)\n\nYou can verify the signatures of both the checksums.txt file and the published docker images using [cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign).\n\n```bash\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt --bundle=checksums.txt.sigstore.json --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n```bash\ncosign verify us-docker.pkg.dev/fairwinds-ops/oss/polaris:v10.2.2 --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n"
